<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} schema={schema}><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'Best',href:'/best/'},{label:'All-in-One Marketing Platforms'}]}/><article><header class="section"><div class="container"><h1>Best All-in-One Marketing Platforms: Count the Tools You Can Actually Retire</h1><p class="lede">“All-in-one” has value only when the platform replaces software you would otherwise pay for and maintain.</p></div></header><div class="narrow prose article-body"><AffiliateDisclosure hasRelationship={true}/><h2>Our shortlist</h2><ul><li><strong>Systeme.io:</strong> budget consolidation across funnels, email, courses and automation.</li><li><strong>GetResponse:</strong> email/automation-led stack; at 1,000 contacts current monthly pricing starts $19 Starter, $59 Marketer and $69 Creator.</li><li><strong>Kartra:</strong> broad campaigns, pages, checkout, memberships and automation.</li><li><strong>HighLevel:</strong> agency/client operations with CRM, communications and sub-accounts.</li><li><strong>Kajabi:</strong> knowledge-business specialization with courses, community and marketing.</li></ul><h2>The TCO test</h2><p>Write down what you pay for email, landing pages/funnels, CRM, checkout, courses, community, calendar, automation and affiliate software. Then mark which subscriptions a candidate can genuinely eliminate. Add usage charges, contact scaling and migration cost. The result is more meaningful than comparing five base prices.</p><h2>Different centers of gravity</h2><p>GetResponse starts from email; Kajabi from knowledge products; HighLevel from agencies; Systeme.io from low-cost consolidation. Kartra is a broader campaign/membership stack. Calling one universally best would erase the reason these products coexist.</p><h2>Verdict</h2><p>Systeme.io is our first comparison for a small operator trying to retire several subscriptions at low fixed cost. GetResponse is stronger when email is the center. HighLevel is the agency choice. Kajabi is the knowledge-business choice. The winning platform is the one that lets you cancel the most redundant tools without breaking the workflow that makes money.</p><p><a class="button" href={aff} rel="sponsored nofollow">Try Systeme.io free</a></p><SourceBlock sources={sources}/><p class="source-note">Facts checked September 10, 2026. We do not treat affiliate status as a ranking criterion and do not claim hands-on testing where none occurred.</p></div></article></BaseLayout>